## Hire offer
<%
    role_title = role.get("title", role_id)
%>
Subject: Offer Letter – ${role_title}

Hi ${candidate_name},

Congratulations! We are thrilled to offer you the position of **${role_title}**.

We were impressed by your skills and believe you will be a great addition to the team.

Please expect a formal offer letter from HR shortly with all the details.

We look forward to having you on board!

Best regards,
${sender_name}
${org_name}
